{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51203","headline":"五言白话诗 十 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下恶官职，不过是府兵。\n四面有贼动，当日即须行。\n有缘重相见，业薄即隔生。\n逢贼被打煞，五品无人诤。\n生住无常界，（项楚云此句以下应移入下一首。\n）攘攘满街行。\n只拟人间死，不肯佛边生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}